flowchart TD
  UI[Windows Tkinter Wizard] --> V[Validate URL / target / policies]
  V --> P[SSH with trusted host keys - RejectPolicy]
  P --> INS[Read live targets.json and SHA-256]
  INS --> D[MCP initialize + tools/list on 3090]
  D --> S[Engineer selects explicit allowed tools]
  S --> REV[Preview manifest and expected base hash]
  REV -->|Explicit approval| APPLY[Atomic new-target registry insert]
  APPLY --> CHECK[aq_check.py filtered tools/list]
  CHECK -->|Failed| RB[CAS-bound rollback from private backup]
  CHECK -->|Passed| READY[Gateway verified]
  READY --> MANUAL[Generate Quick Local SSH command and chips]
  MANUAL --> QUICK[User manually saves connector in Quick]
  QUICK --> FRESH[New chat / verify safe read]
  INS --> EXIST[Existing Git / Local target]
  EXIST --> VALID[Preflight existing launcher]
  VALID --> MANUAL
  DIPS[(Quick DIPS SQLite)] -. Read-only schema inspection only .-> UI
